Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,棺材上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coffin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你名字的缩写 J.B.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it has your initials, J.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是我们的共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this moment, rather him than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.64,0:00:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你不必动手除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you've been saved the effort of removing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:01:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说布瓦上校在睡眠中过世的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Bouvar passed away in his sleep, so they tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听你的口气 好像没亲手杀死他而很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound disappointed you did not kill him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.95,0:01:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 布瓦上校杀了我两名同仁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am. Jacques Bouvar murdered two of my colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有别的事 我们法国工作站能帮上忙的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything else our French station can do for Monsiuer Bond?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许待会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.02,0:01:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如我所说 待会儿 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said, later. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madame...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来向你致最深的哀悼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come to offer my sincere condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲爱的布瓦上校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Colonel Bouvar...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该自 己动手开车门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you should have opened that car door by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个穿著不错的老傢伙 也应该有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No well-dressed man should be without one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 非常实际\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, very practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.14,0:04:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 追来了 - 快! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're coming to get me. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《007系列之霹雳弹》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准停车 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no parking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 拉果先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pardon, Monsieur Largo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,国际兄弟会协助 无国籍人士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The International Brotherhood for the Assistance of Stateless Persons...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.16,0:08:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹是博爱性质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is purely philanthropic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对政治不感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not interested in politics...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只对恢复你的权利有兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only in your rehabilitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已安排好巴西签证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been able to arrange for visas at the Brazilian Consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟会会照顾你们 直到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Brotherhood will look after you until...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 早 拉果先生 - 早\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, Mr. Largo. - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很高兴你再回来 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice to have you back again. - Thank you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们会偿还一切 - 没有必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We pay back everything! - There will be no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有私人企业捐款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have certain funds from private individuals who share our aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号 坐下 我们等下讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Number Two. We will discuss...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的北约计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your NATO project later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾通知大家 幽灵六号的死讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret to inform you all of the death of Spectre Number Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布瓦上校遭到不知名刺客杀害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Colonel Jacques Bouvar was killed by an unknown assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的成就会被记住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His services will be greatly missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在进行各地区财物报告 七号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will now proceed with the area financial reports. Number Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.11,0:09:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勒索双重间谍 马兹富吉瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blackmail of the double agent Matsou Fujiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:25.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸地 只有四千万日币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, only 40 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他只有这么多 - 十号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All the man had. - Number Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝拉的暗杀案 那位法国反物质专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assassination of Perringe, the French antimatter specialist...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃往俄国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who went over to the Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从特别部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three million francs from the special department...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 弄到三百万法郎 - 五号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- of the Quai D'Orsay. - Number Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在英国的火车劫案 二十五万英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our consultation fee for the British train robbery: 250,000 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中共和美国贩毒份子的捐献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Distribution of Red China narcotics in the United States...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二百三十万元 由九号和我亲自去收的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2,300,000 dollars, collected by Number Nine and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.11,0:09:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二百三十万…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two million three...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:10:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的估计应该要高点 十一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our expectations were considerably higher, Number 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉丁美洲的竞争 价格下跌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Competition from Latin America. Prices are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经预测到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I anticipated that factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定所有的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you quite sure all monies...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都由你本人和九号清点过吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been accounted for by yourself and Number Nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 一号 每一分钱都点过 - 正好相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To the penny, Number One. - On the contrary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你们之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have satisfied myself that one of you is clearly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一人盗用公款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guilty of embezzlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼党要求党员们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spectre is a dedicated fraternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose strength lies in the absolute integrity of its members.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已知道罪犯是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The culprit is known to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定采取适当的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have decided on the appropriate action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在进行新的方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us now proceed with new business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.29,0:11:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由负责北约计划的二号来讲解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will hear from Number Two, who's in charge of our NATO project...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是魔鬼党有史以来 最有野心的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most ambitious Spectre has ever undertaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号 你来报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your report, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一号 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Number One.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的目的 是要向北大西洋公约组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our intention is to demand a ransom...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要求赎金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the North Atlantic Treaty Powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二亿八千万美金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of 280 million dollars...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.81,0:11:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一亿英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 million pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已派力比男爵探员 到英国南部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have sent Spectre agent Count Lippe to the south of England...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作必要的准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he is making the necessary preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.75,0:11:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在一家健身诊所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is at a health clinic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诊所座落在北约基地附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}conveniently located near the NATO air base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 派特? - 哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Pat? - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 洗完澡 我再来找你 - 很快就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you when I've had a shower. - I'll soon be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 邦德先生 力比男爵 - 你不会要带她走吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Bond, Count Lippe. - You're not taking her away already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是这乏噪无味的地方 唯一的乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the only joy in this dreary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出你也发现这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've discovered that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 派特 再半小时 - 我会马上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About half an hour, Pat. - I'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听过这句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to have met you, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很怪的伤 跌倒的吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny looking bruise. A fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被一个寡妇拿火钳弄伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A poker in the hands of a widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很意外 我以为你很对寡妇的口味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised. I'd have thought you were just the type for a widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:10.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位可不是 他完全不喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this one. He didn't like me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红色方块 中间有个长钉穿过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A red square with a spike through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为是个秘密记号 澳门的红龙组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a Tong sign, the red dragon from Macao.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要记录组帮我查证一下 - 甜心 抱歉 你在休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ask records to verify it for me. - Sorry, sweetie. You're off duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你回来时 再通知你 - 钱班霓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- File it till you get back. - Moneypenny...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次看到你 我会将你压在膝下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}next time I see you, I'll put you across my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外加果冻和柠檬汁? 我等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On yogurt and lemon juice? I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.72,0:12:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派特 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Pat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听不到你 你昏倒了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hear you. Have you fainted?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(力比爵士)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 你迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真认不出我自 己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd never have recognized myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:26.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我还好吗? - 可惜太健康了 请脱掉浴袍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do I seem healthy? - Too healthy. Take off your bathrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的口气好像不很坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never say that as if you meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手举过头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arms above your head, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 安分点 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behave yourself, Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.35,0:14:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看只有一个地方能让你安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see there's only one place to keep you quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活动伸张椅 调整脊椎骨用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A motorized traction table for stretching the spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:15:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人称苦刑架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some patients call it the rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这倒不意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踢踏板在哪? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the kick starter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了 面向下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop fooling around and face down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面向下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力比男爵隔壁的人是谁? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, who is the man in the room next to your Count Lippe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对他不太清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really don't know too much about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安吉洛先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Mr. Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟私人医生一起来 疗治一场可怕车祸的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here with a private physician, recuperating from an awful car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次我一整天 感觉真正安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, now, the first time I've felt really safe all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:34.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我15分钟后再来看你的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll look in and see how you're doing in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:56.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢老天 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会被害死 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:35.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定高了 6英寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must be six inches taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.37,0:16:38.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的傢伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You poor dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想不出怎么会发生? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think how it could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以告诉你 简直是奇迹 我会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can tell you, it's a miracle I came back when I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:49.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你一定是无意间 碰到了开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only think that you must have pushed the switch accidentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better come along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在蒸气室待一下 会帮助你放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spend a few minutes in the steam room. It'll help to relax you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好 - 也许能帮你缩回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Might even shrink you back to size.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:17:00.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人希望今天的事没有发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's going to wish today had never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会告诉威医生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't tell Dr. Wain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 我会丢饭碗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I'd lose my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.53,0:17:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我沉默总有个代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose my silence could have a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是指…不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mean... Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会见 鳄鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later, irrigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在搞什么飞机? - 别担心 我会告诉大厨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you doing? - Don't you worry. I'll tell the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我出去 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out of this bloody machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.27,0:18:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(热疗中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.08,0:18:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以消除紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reduces the tensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我不管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杜瓦少校社交秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Derval's social secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我找安吉洛先生 - 什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would like to speak to Mr. Angelo. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 安吉洛先生 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Angelo. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.78,0:18:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拨错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想脱掉这个 会不会舒服些…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think you could be more comfortable if you take off this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事? - 杜瓦少校?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Major Derval?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是 我就是 - 你的车在等了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Major Derval. - Your car is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我马上下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be down right away. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的车来了 任务到了 我的生活故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My car's here. Duty calls. The story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到空军基地会迟到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be late at the air base.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此外 你会有时间冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it will give you time to cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.51,0:19:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来时 你还在此吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be here when I come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候也许就没心情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I may not be in the mood then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.22,0:19:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要打赌吗? - 你很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you wanna bet? - You know your Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解我自 己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说过会下去 - 先生 你的外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told him I'd be down. - Your coat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,降落愉快 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy landing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要乖 至少到我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be good, at least until I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:54.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没人看见我们 走道没人 - 门关上 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody saw us. The corridor's empty. - Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了 力比 你掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead all right. Lippe, you take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 医生和救护车在外面吗? - 一切都如计划安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are the doctor and ambulance outside? - Everything as arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安吉洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的呼吸器具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your breathing equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔离氧气系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolates you from the oxygen supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.61,0:20:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伽马毒气 浓缩式 你刚用的那种 而最重要的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamma gas. Instantaneous. Type you just used. And most important...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.69,0:20:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不够 十万元不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough. 100,000 dollars is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想说什么? - 我改变主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you trying to say? - I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我花了两年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,研究影片 报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}studying the film, the reports...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,易容手术 模仿声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plastic operations, voice lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是二十五万好了 要不你找别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it a quarter of a million, or get someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有别人 - 没错 我是杜瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no one else. - Exactly. I am Derval.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收起来 安吉洛说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that away. Angelo is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:20:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会通知一号 我们已重新安排过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll inform Number One we made a new arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是定金而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is merely a down payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 但我要二十五万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, but against a quarter of a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 同意 - 他的表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Agreed. - His watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身分辨明卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Identification Disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 再见 ! - 不 他总说再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Au revoir! - No, he always says ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帽子戴得太后面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cap's too far back on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.69,0:21:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的钱 准备好就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of my money, just have it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 帮他换上睡袍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get him into his pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 麻烦证件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, identity, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是单机出击例行训练 你们将有一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a normal training sortie, and you'll be accompanied...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.83,0:22:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北约代表同行 杜瓦少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a NATO representative, Commandant Derval...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北约杜瓦少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Derval of NATO.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.57,0:22:11.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,例行性飞行 驾驶猎犬式飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a routine flight. You'll be flying a Vulcan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高度四万五千英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at an altitude of 45,000 feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,携带二枚 M.O.S. 核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}armed with two atomic bombs, M.O.S. Type.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷管一样 在白色安全盒里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuses as usual in the white security box.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.05,0:22:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些可恶的飞机 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, those damned aeroplanes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.15,0:22:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够让你发疯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're enough to drive you mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:23:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非是你那个皮草手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless, of course, it's that mink glove of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去把噪音关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll shut out the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 你要去哪儿? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪儿都不去 我只想运动一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowhere. I thought I'd take a little exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.01,0:23:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.99,0:25:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能效劳吗? 郡府警局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you? County Police here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.00,0:26:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么回事? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.57,0:26:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大门口电铃吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could it be the front doorbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.80,0:26:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 绝对不是 - 那会是谁? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It most certainly could not. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚上运动得还不够吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you had enough exercise for one evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.74,0:26:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会这么说真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny you should say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.92,0:26:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回转时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point of return...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.82,0:26:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,45分30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}45 minutes, 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.56,0:26:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人工操作换成自动驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch from manual to auto.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换成自动了 少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's set on automatic. Commandant...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.76,0:26:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能和副驾驶换位子吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you care to change places with the copilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里视野比较好 - 我很乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Better view up here. - I'd be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.64,0:27:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是南方雷达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Southern Radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正在被雷达监视中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now under positive radar control.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不被允许的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is avoiding action.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.35,0:28:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请说出方位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Request you report your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:54.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿著 好吗? 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this, will you? What's the flap, Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.43,0:28:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,O-B-N-R 长官 北约训练飞行 监控站告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O-B-N-R, sir. NATO training flight. Air traffic flashed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:28:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在雷达上消失 到处找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They lost it on radar. We haven't been able to pick it up anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.20,0:29:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它从荧幕上消失前 最后高度是多少 ? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was she losing altitude when she went off the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.77,0:29:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当快 三百英尺以下我们搜不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rapidly. We can't scan below 300 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.34,0:29:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许坠机 - 她发生问题吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She may have gone down. - Was she in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.34,0:29:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次报告中没有 约在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not according to the last report, which came from about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.41,0:29:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她携带武器对吗? - 两枚核子武器 M.O.S. 型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She is armed, isn't she? - Two atomic weapons, M.O.S. Type.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派出所有的人 到附近区域地毯式搜索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get everything you can into the area. A thorough search.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.22,0:29:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻通知总部 第一优先 绝对机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notify the Admiralty at once. Top priority. Absolute security.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.69,0:29:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 同时联络华府 - 遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ask them to contact Washington. - Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.96,0:29:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有看到别的东西吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything else in sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.56,0:29:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 一切没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.39,0:29:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开水下降落灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch on the underwater landing lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开水下舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the underwater hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.08,0:35:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 待命接潜水艇 - 绞盘 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand by to winch in the submarine. - Man the winches!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.13,0:35:50.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 快把盒子拿给古先生 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give these bomb fuses to Mr. Kutze. - Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.90,0:35:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快把潜艇弄出来 把炸弹放进容器内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the submarine up quickly and the bombs loaded in the containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.47,0:36:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤古 对你新玩具满意吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kutze, are you pleased with your new toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.71,0:36:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些新安全装置 秘密控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some new safety device. A secret control.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.64,0:36:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么是伟大的古斯 处理不了 ? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can they have that the great Ladislav Kutze cannot handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.01,0:36:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我实验室里 生活单纯多 了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life was much simpler in my Warsaw laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.28,0:36:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的那份相当于 几份的诺贝尔奖金? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your share will amount to how many Nobel Prizes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.76,0:36:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往前拉 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.73,0:36:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来 停 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More. Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从巴黎来的 一号在线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paris, sir. Number One on the scrambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.43,0:36:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是二号 第二步完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Two speaking. Phase two completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号做的很好 不像力比爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number Two has done well, unlike Count Lippe...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.20,0:37:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选择了安吉洛 差点危害到我们计划的成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose choice of Angelo might have jeopardized the success of our project.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.91,0:37:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传话到刺杀部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a message to the Execution Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.48,0:37:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少每天写信或打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will write, or telephone at the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.31,0:37:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉 如此急急忙忙的走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day by day. I'm truly sorry I have to dash off like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.92,0:37:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但办公室有急事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a bit of a flap at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.95,0:37:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你从事哪方面行业? - 我到处旅游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What kind of work do you do? - I travel...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.49,0:37:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,类似处理疑难杂症的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sort of a licensed troubleshooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安吉洛先生 昨晚心脏病发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Angelo. Heart attack last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.76,0:37:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.90,0:37:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 保持联络 - 詹姆斯 随时随地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep in touch. - Anytime, James. Anyplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.47,0:37:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改天改地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another time, another place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.37,0:38:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你迟到了 ! - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are late! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.64,0:38:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时下有些人开车 真的很令人火大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people on the road really burn you up these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.11,0:39:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在会议室 重大事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the conference room. Something pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.68,0:39:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欧洲每位0 0探员都到齐 还有内政大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every Double-0 man in Europe has been rushed in, and the Home Secretary too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.98,0:39:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他太太的狗可能走失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His wife's probably lost her dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 现在人都到齐了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, now that we're all here...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.58,0:39:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首相要内政大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister has asked the Home Secretary...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.11,0:39:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代表他来此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come and represent him here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.32,0:39:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内政大臣请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Home Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.92,0:39:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 你们将要听到的录音带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, the tape that you are about to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.52,0:39:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是今早十点收到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was received at 10 Downing Street this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.03,0:39:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的首相先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.53,0:39:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二枚核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two atomic bombs...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.53,0:39:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四 五 六和四 五 七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}numbers 4-5-6 and 4-5-7...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.17,0:39:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装载在北约7 5 9号飞机上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which were aboard NATO flight 7-5-9...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已归魔鬼党所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are now in the possession of Spectre.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.87,0:40:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非在往后七日 贵政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless within the next seven days your government...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.31,0:40:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,付给我们 一亿英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pays to us 100 million pounds sterling...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.55,0:40:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们就会发射飞弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a manner to be designated by us...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.75,0:40:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸毁 英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall destroy a major city in England...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.86,0:40:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或美国重要城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the United States of America.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.39,0:40:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请在明天下午六点钟时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please signal your acceptance of our terms by arranging...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.23,0:40:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将伦敦大钟敲响七下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for Big Ben to strike seven times...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示接受我们的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at 6:00 p. m. Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.04,0:40:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首相和总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister and the President...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.61,0:40:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经透过电话商讨 并同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have talked together over the hot line and have agreed...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.38,0:40:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非找回炸弹 不然就得付款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that unless the bombs are recovered, payment will have to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.12,0:40:38.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了避免重大惊慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To avoid general panic...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.95,0:40:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前将仍列为机密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}complete secrecy will be maintained and no press announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.49,0:40:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首相要你们部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister has asked that your department...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.93,0:40:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负责所有行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take charge of the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.93,0:40:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 约翰爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.38,0:41:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这记录表示猎犬式飞机 最大行程的范围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This circle represents the full flying range of the Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.15,0:41:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全面搜查已找不到任何 失事或降落的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extensive search has failed to locate any evidence of either a crash...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.29,0:41:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全世界的报告已证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or landing, and worldwide reports have proved negative...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.33,0:41:19.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各机场也未有猎犬式飞机降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on all airfields large enough to handle the Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.30,0:41:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是目前仅有的资料 - 约翰爵士 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's all we have, sir. - Thank you, Sir John.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.13,0:41:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你们继续接手这个案子 我们会以十号线保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll leave you to carry on. We'll keep you in touch from Number 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.74,0:41:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.94,0:41:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在打开前面的卷宗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may now open the folders in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.76,0:41:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代号: 霹雳弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Code name: Thunderball.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.26,0:41:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也看得出来 资料不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, we've very little to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有机员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the members of the crew...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.87,0:41:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都经过最安全的检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had top security clearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.07,0:41:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照片都在档案里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find their photographs and service records in your files.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.44,0:42:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们将和北约组织 中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be working with NATO, C.I. A...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及所有盟国情治单位一起合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all allied intelligence units.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.85,0:42:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.28,0:42:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到你们和我讨论个人任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you discuss your individual assignments with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.35,0:42:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我派你去加拿大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've assigned you to station C, Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.33,0:42:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克上尉会是你空军指导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Group Captain Pritchard here will be your Air Force liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.16,0:42:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 我很慎重 建议你派我去拿索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I respectfully suggest that you change my assignment to Nassau.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.43,0:42:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了你热衷水上运动外 还有别的理由吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there any other reason besides your enthusiasm of water sports?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.27,0:42:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.51,0:42:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 如何? - 有一张这个人的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well? - There was a photograph of that man...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.64,0:42:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在档案夹里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this dossier you gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.65,0:42:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他名叫杜瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Derval.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.65,0:42:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚看到他 但他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him last night at Shrublands, but he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.82,0:42:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不可能 他昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, sir. Not possible. He was seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.22,0:42:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还登上猎犬式飞机起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}boarding the Vulcan and took off last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.26,0:42:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果007他说昨晚 看见杜瓦死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If 007 says he saw Derval last night and he was dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.73,0:42:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会再质问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's enough for me to initiate inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.47,0:42:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.20,0:42:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这女孩是谁? - 杜瓦的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is this girl? - Derval's sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:42:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 知道她现在在哪吗? - 拿索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you know where she is now? - Nassau.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.64,0:43:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为有必要调查她吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think she's worth going after?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.88,0:43:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't put it quite that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.12,0:43:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有四天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've only got four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.72,0:43:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别花时间坐在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't spend your time sitting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.35,0:43:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.13,0:43:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.43,0:43:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.53,0:43:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身材真好 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smashing figure. I don't suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.77,0:43:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这和你请求毫无关系吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that has anything to do with your request?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.50,0:43:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是天生被人误会的人? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there ever a man more misunderstood?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.74,0:43:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你骗不过我的双眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't pull the wool over my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.94,0:43:30.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许能骗老头子 但我很清楚 我能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may be able to con the old man, but I know better. I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.91,0:43:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样 钱班霓小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I, Miss Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.22,0:43:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不叫我老头子 我会感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'll thank you not to refer to me as the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.59,0:43:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我进来时有顶帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I had a hat when I came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.43,0:43:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么认出她? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else will you recognize her?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对错不了 她左大腿上有二个胎记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't miss. She has two moles on the left thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.48,0:45:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢你… - 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, Mr... - James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.95,0:45:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在你下水后就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I arrived soon after you went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.05,0:45:07.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我很欣赏你的姿态 - 是吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've been admiring your form. - Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.22,0:45:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫詹姆斯邦德 而很欣赏我的姿态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name's James Bond and you've been admiring my form.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.69,0:45:12.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分的女孩只是在玩水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most girls just paddle around.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.06,0:45:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你游得跟男人一样 - 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You swim like a man. - So do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.83,0:45:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我常常练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had quite a bit of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.33,0:45:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你常来吗? - 无聊的时候就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you come here often? - Whenever I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.04,0:45:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 每天都来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Practically every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.91,0:45:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还做些什么? 在哪做? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else do you do, and where?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.04,0:45:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你从不浪费时间 是吗? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't waste time, do you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.51,0:45:29.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当纪念 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For effort. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.51,0:45:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会穿戴起来 下次你就认得出我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wear it so you know me next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.08,0:45:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说得没错 绝对错不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was right. Couldn't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.15,0:45:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不明白 - 很快就会明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not with you. - You soon will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.03,0:45:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝拉 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paula!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.26,0:45:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉我一把 好吗? - 上来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me a hand, will you? - Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.27,0:45:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知伦敦我联络上那个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell London I've made contact with the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.74,0:45:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为那是"联络"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not what I'd call contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.21,0:45:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说你看见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pass it through you've seen the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.11,0:46:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 继续加油 - 发动不了 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep trying. - It won't start!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.02,0:46:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马达坏了 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahoy there! Our motor's conked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.53,0:46:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会要去珊瑚港附近吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't be going anywhere near Coral Harbor, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.56,0:46:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来不去 但可以绕一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't, but I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.36,0:46:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个很重要的约会 会很感激你送我一程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a very important appointment. I'd appreciate a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.60,0:46:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来吧 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come aboard then!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意搭别的船吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't mind taking the service boat, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.51,0:46:22.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.84,0:46:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.09,0:47:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许我们还能在泳池边午餐 - 你的紧急约会呢? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perhaps lunch by the pool. - How about your urgent appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.04,0:47:27.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里多久? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.11,0:47:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约三周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.11,0:47:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都这么多问题吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you ever stop asking questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.42,0:47:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 改变战略 喝点我的海鲜汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Change of tack. Have some of my conch chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.76,0:47:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 你搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been reading the wrong books, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.16,0:47:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 海鲜汤吗? - 当一名调情圣手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About conch chowder? - Being an aphrodisiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.16,0:47:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正好喜欢海鲜汤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just so happens that I like conch chowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.87,0:47:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.74,0:47:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 为我监护人工作 - 你的监护人监视你? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Works for my guardian. - Your guardian has you watched?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.24,0:47:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他喜欢知道我在哪 - 我不怪他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He likes to know where I am. - I don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.72,0:48:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 恕我失陪 - 你不会这么快就走吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will you excuse me? - You're not going so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.39,0:48:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我监护人的游艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guardian's yacht.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.03,0:48:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.43,0:48:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在等我 - 我能和你去吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll be expecting me. - May I come with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.94,0:48:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 想见见你的监护人 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd love to meet your guardian. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 能再见到你吗? - 这岛很小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will I see you again? - It's a small island.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.71,0:48:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许能一起吃晚餐 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perhaps we can have dinner together. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.31,0:48:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真不合作的多明诺 - 你怎么知道? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My dear, uncooperative Domino. - How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.88,0:48:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我朋友 叫我多明诺? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know my friends call me Domino?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.98,0:48:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脚踝的链子上写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the bracelet on your ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.25,0:48:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你眼睛真利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sharp little eyes you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.83,0:48:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你尝到我的厉害之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till you get to my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.74,0:48:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 明天见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye then. See you tomorrow on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.25,0:49:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 五百英镑 - 好的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 500 pounds, please. - Certainly, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.75,0:49:31.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.25,0:49:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.49,0:49:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿去 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.87,0:49:50.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.39,0:50:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.53,0:50:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总要有人输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.90,0:50:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我以为你肩后有魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I thought I saw a spectre at your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.50,0:50:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.57,0:50:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失败的魔鬼 你要改运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spectre of defeat. Your luck was due to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.84,0:50:25.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll soon find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.88,0:50:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提高赌注有异议吗? 五百英镑?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any objection to raise the limit? 500 pounds shall we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.58,0:50:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 太大了 - 我也退出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too big for me. - Count me out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.95,0:50:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你想接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you would like to take the shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.99,0:50:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友不会介意 先生是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend won't mind, Mr...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 邦德 - 是 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bond. - Oh, yes. Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.69,0:50:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我有位同事提过你 - 希望不是坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One of my associates spoke about you. - Nothing bad, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.73,0:50:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的魔鬼跟我的对抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your spectre against mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.07,0:50:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望我走厄运? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish to put the evil eye on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.21,0:50:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来的地方有种对付的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a way to deal with that where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.44,0:50:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许会骗到我 看看对牌如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may hex me. Let's see what it does for the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.48,0:51:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不要了 - 七点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.45,0:51:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.24,0:51:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.24,0:51:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.55,0:51:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 你好像打不败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be unbeatable, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.28,0:51:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前而已 这种事维持不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the moment. This sort of thing can't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.82,0:51:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米里欧 你答应请我一杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilio, you promised to buy me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.82,0:51:35.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 马上 我要先赢回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, my dear. I want to get my money back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.92,0:51:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能容我请小姐一杯酒吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I be allowed to buy the lady a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.83,0:51:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我会很感激 - 那我必须换手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would appreciate that. - Then I must pass the shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.97,0:51:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他不改手气 他会变得很无理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to be impossible if his luck doesn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.54,0:51:52.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想今晚是不会变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow, I don't think it will tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.85,0:51:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鱼子酱 房派里昂55年份的酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beluga caviar, Dom Perignon, '55.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.48,0:51:59.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Monsieur. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.15,0:52:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是拉果先生的侄女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand you're Mr. Largo's niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.49,0:52:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要比情妇好听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds better than... What would you say? Mistress? Kept woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.03,0:52:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会这么说 你在哪儿认识他的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't say that. Where did you meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.80,0:52:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在凯菲勒 我跟我哥法兰克斯在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Capri. I was there with my brother, Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.94,0:52:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪 我发现艾米里欧很有魅力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange. I found Emilio attractive...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.31,0:52:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.51,0:52:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他住在船上吗? - 不 在岛上有房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does he live aboard the yacht? - No. He has a house on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.81,0:52:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 一定要谈他吗? - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Must we talk about him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.71,0:52:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我情愿跳舞 - 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd much rather dance. - So would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.89,0:52:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你哥现在在哪儿? - 英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is your brother now? - In England.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.56,0:52:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是北约空军少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Commandant with the NATO forces there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.36,0:52:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他人很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.90,0:52:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我却一直遇不到他那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trouble is I never meet anyone like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.84,0:52:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 只遇上拉果和我这种人 - 你不像拉果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only men like Largo and myself. - You are not like Largo.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.64,0:52:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.21,0:52:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何这么说? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.68,0:53:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抱我的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.43,0:53:06.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.67,0:53:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在拿索待多久? - 后天离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long are you staying in Nassau? - We're going the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.97,0:53:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过 我们时间不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I said, we haven't got much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.28,0:53:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米里欧想要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emilio wants to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.82,0:53:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚睡在船上吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sleeping aboard tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.72,0:53:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你别这么露骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hoped you'd not be so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.49,0:53:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当一个人时间不多 行动必须露骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, when one has so little time, one sort of has to be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.26,0:53:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道哪儿能找到我 - 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know where you can find me. - Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.16,0:53:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你侄女是位好舞者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your niece is an excellent dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.50,0:53:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我向你证明我是名好输家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me prove I'm as good a loser as you are a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.00,0:53:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周日来吃中饭 我在波米拉的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to lunch on Sunday. The Palmyra. It's my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.31,0:53:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就决定在周日 中午\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunday at noon, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.31,0:53:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.84,0:53:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good night. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.91,0:53:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得逐字告诉我 邦德说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must tell me what Mr. Bond had to say, word for word.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.28,0:53:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他谈起一些你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He talked about you a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.29,0:54:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚说了什么? 我没听清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was he saying just then? I didn't quite hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.42,0:54:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他问今晚我们是否睡在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked were we sleeping aboard tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.52,0:54:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.48,0:54:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的钥匙 3 0 4房 - 3 0 4房 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My key. It's 304, please. - Thank you. 304.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.98,0:54:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 没有信 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry, no mail. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.63,0:56:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗 0 0…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hello, 00...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.36,0:57:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样对待中情局真不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a fine way to treat the C.I.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.63,0:57:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 菲立 但你正要说007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that, Felix, but you were about to say 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.06,0:57:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.47,0:57:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他没? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.57,0:57:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该最了解我 去吧 笑面虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me better than that. Here you go, Smiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.48,0:57:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到你到此想看的吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you seen everything you came to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.05,0:57:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回你朋友那里去报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your friends and report.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.01,0:57:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他 小鱼我丢回海里给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them, the little fish I throw back into the sea. Give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要从我背后开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to shoot me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.05,0:57:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是指枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gun, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.46,0:57:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.43,0:57:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是谁? - 小鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was he? - Like I said, a small fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.57,0:57:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替拉果先生工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working for a Mr. Largo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.60,0:57:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有艘游艇 我们待会儿该去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got a yacht we should take a look at later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.01,0:57:53.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要见拉果先生 - 让他进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Quist to see Mr. Largo. - Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.72,0:58:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(波米拉 私人处所 非请莫入)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.40,0:58:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事? 是克利斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes? It's Quist.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.34,0:58:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻松点 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gently, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.57,0:58:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你查到什么? - 什么也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you find? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.84,0:58:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你见到邦德了 ? - 见到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw Bond? - Yes, I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.64,0:58:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出 了什么事? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.45,0:58:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让他制服了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let him get the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.42,0:58:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你好 你终于联络上了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there, did you finally make contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.12,0:59:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你迟到了 菲立 史莱德 我们在此的伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're late. Felix Leiter, this is Pinder, our man here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.26,0:59:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 幸会 - 各位 这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you do? - This way, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.23,0:59:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那女孩是谁? - 宝拉 我这儿的助手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the girl? - Paula Kaplan, my assistant here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:14.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有造访 美国的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has no plans to visit the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.17,0:59:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now here's a special announcement...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.18,0:59:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,BB C外电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the Overseas Service of the B.B.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大钟今晚六点时 确实敲了七下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big Ben actually did strike seven times at 6:00 this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.12,0:59:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为1895年的雷电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was caused by a mechanical failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.12,0:59:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所造成的机械故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which last occurred during a violent electrical storm in 1898.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.26,0:59:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们再度回到头条新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here once again are the headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.73,0:59:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然是在拖延时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously stalling for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.27,0:59:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 ! - 啊 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, no! - Ah, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.57,0:59:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真棒的惊喜 - 我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What a wonderful surprise. - For me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.31,0:59:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说 我觉得这些 你用来逃命的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must say, I find this business of equipping you in the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.61,0:59:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是 非常的不寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the run, as it were... highly irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.95,0:59:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是盖氏计算仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we have a Geiger counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.45,0:59:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实用而不易损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useful and unobtrusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.45,0:59:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个短针会计算辐射能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sweep hand takes the radioactivity count.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.62,1:00:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然也是防水的 - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's waterproof, of course. - But of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.79,1:00:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你特别小心这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, here's something I want you to use with special care.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.67,1:00:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 特别小心 - 你所给我的一切…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With special care. - Everything you give me...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.17,1:00:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全都很小心使用 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is treated with equal contempt. Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.44,1:00:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是一具水底相机 按这个钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's an underwater camera. It takes eight pictures...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.08,1:00:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能连续拍八张照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in rapid succession by pressing that button there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.48,1:00:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个设计很特别吗? - 如果你可以在黑暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that clever? - If you can take pictures...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.58,1:00:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用红外线底片拍照 那就很特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the dark with an infrared film, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.72,1:00:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试著别像往常滥用 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to be a little less than your usual frivolous self, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.29,1:00:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是迷你信号弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a miniature Very pistol...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.73,1:00:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能发射很亮的红色信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which fires a bright red flare, a distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.57,1:00:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该全天候随身携带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should keep it on you day and night.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.40,1:00:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢你最后 说的那句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I resent that remark.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.74,1:00:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你介意吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.48,1:00:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你在水下无法呼吸时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, in the event of a re-breather not being available...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.91,1:00:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以使用这个装置 当然只是短时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can use this device for short periods only, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.92,1:00:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约四分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, about four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.19,1:00:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 聪明 - 不到最后关头别用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clever. - You'll only use it as a last resort.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.49,1:01:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很适合放在口袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It closes to a convenient pocket size.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.36,1:01:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设有这样的口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming one has a convenient pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.23,1:01:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意 最近发明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now pay attention. A recently developed...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.43,1:01:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无害无线电装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}harmless radioactive device.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.87,1:01:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harmless.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.34,1:01:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自动发射至特殊接收器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sends out a homing signal to a special receiver.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.11,1:01:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我该如何使用 ? - 很显然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What am I supposed to do with this? - Obviously, you...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.18,1:01:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得吞下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.78,1:01:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.72,1:01:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望她今晚还会停留在原地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope she'll still be lying in the same place tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们待会儿 可以用这双船身的船 当聚会的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use this catamaran as a rendezvous place for later.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.83,1:01:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.50,1:01:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带她进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.90,1:01:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个容器将会被投至 高棉海岸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A container will be dropped off the coast of Burma...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.84,1:01:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满古群岛附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the Megui Archipelago...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.04,1:01:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,落座于北纬2 0度 东经6 0度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}latitude 20 degrees north, longitude 60 degrees east...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.35,1:01:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间是在五月二十七日 格林威治时间下午八点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at 20 hundred hours Greenwich mean time on May 27.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.32,1:01:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有重3到8克拉不等的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will hold blue-white flawless diamonds between...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.46,1:02:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无暇的蓝白钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three and eight carats.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.33,1:02:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总价值不准低于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Total value to be not less than 100 million pounds...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.53,1:02:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在市价的一百亿英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}present market price.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.27,1:02:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们收取容器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we have recovered the container...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.84,1:02:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确认无误后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and verified its contents...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.84,1:02:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将以无线电频率 1 6点2 3兆赫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will be notified on radio frequency 16.23 megacycles...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.68,1:02:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知你们 何处可以找到核弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the atomic bombs may be recovered.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.98,1:02:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯纳生 立刻去准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kenniston, you'd better get on to De Beers at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.22,1:02:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.65,1:02:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位 除非找到炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, gentlemen, unless those bombs are found...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.36,1:02:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恐怕我们得付款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very much afraid we'll have to pay their price.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.59,1:02:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 长官 - 噢 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir? - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.76,1:02:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,007拿索传来的电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Signal from 007 in Nassau.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.86,1:02:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一 、 二件事 会引起我们的兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One or two things that might interest us.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.07,1:02:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪斯可戈兰号仍在港口 停泊在赌场航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Disco Volante is still in the harbor, lying off the casino channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.54,1:02:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双船身的船也在 能利用它当掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The catamaran is there too, so we can use it for cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.14,1:02:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 你们可以在船后放我下水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fine. You can drop me in the water behind her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.08,1:02:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 伦敦有进一步的消息吗? - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any further news from London? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.18,1:02:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍是2 7 日晚上八点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero hour is still 20 hundred hours on the 27th.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.08,1:02:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在只剩5 5小时 - 我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's just 55 hours from now. - Yes. Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.69,1:03:01.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里可以了 - 我们在潘德那儿见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, this will do here. - We'll meet back at Pinder's.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.00,1:03:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.16,1:03:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开水下灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn the underwater lights on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.87,1:04:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开闭路电视 特写的 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}TV, closed-circuit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.26,1:04:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand grenades.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.87,1:04:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.01,1:04:45.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.76,1:05:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.91,1:05:44.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边有东西 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there's something there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.67,1:06:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推进器一定撞到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look! Must have hit him with the propeller.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.07,1:06:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们回去告诉拉果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get back and tell Largo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.94,1:06:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 能载我一程吗? - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I have a lift? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.98,1:06:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 你救了我一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. You just about saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.71,1:06:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的船翻了 我得游上岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My outboard capsized, so I had to swim ashore.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.32,1:07:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要到哪儿? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far do you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.56,1:07:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好系上安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better fasten your safety belt.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.53,1:07:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.46,1:07:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.33,1:07:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休娜戈比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fiona Volpe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.39,1:07:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你常来这儿吗? - 我让你紧张吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you fly here often? - Do I make you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.69,1:07:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我只是不想一晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's just that I have no desire...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.20,1:07:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被困住二次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be capsized twice in one night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.17,1:07:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你不必游上岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you won't have to swim ashore.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.31,1:07:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 你以前来过这吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been here before, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.61,1:07:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 但这是往拿索的路吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I haven't. But this is the road to Nassau?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.85,1:07:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 总会到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.31,1:08:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就到这儿 - 我也是 这是我的旅社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, this is as far as I go. - Me too. This is my hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.12,1:08:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真巧 - 是 真方便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What a coincidence. - Yes, so convenient.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.86,1:08:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脸色很苍白 希望我没吓到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look pale. I hope I didn't frighten you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.63,1:08:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一向是位紧张的乘客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I've always been a nervous passenger.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.63,1:08:38.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些男人不喜欢被载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some men just don't like to be driven.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.63,1:08:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 有些男人只是 不想被载著兜风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, some men just don't like to be taken for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.84,1:08:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.45,1:08:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水下舱门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An underwater hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.45,1:08:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来他们这样进出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. So that's how they could leave and get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.75,1:09:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 又没人看见 很显然 整个行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and nobody saw them. Obviously the whole operation...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.22,1:09:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都在水下进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was carried out underwater.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.22,1:09:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以那是我们要找飞机的地方 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where we'll have to look for the plane. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.93,1:09:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等照片干了之后 我会送到旅社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bring the prints to the hotel when they're dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.55,1:09:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了 空军已经搜索了 拿索250英里内的周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget the Air Force searched the area 250 miles out of Nassau.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.55,1:09:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定在范围外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be beyond that radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.72,1:09:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是迪斯可戈兰号 那晚停的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's if the Disco Volante was out that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.29,1:09:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 但海港管制员说 她只出去了六小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure she was, but harbor control said for only six hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.50,1:09:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六小时内不可能航行五百英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She couldn't cover 500 miles in that time, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.90,1:09:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在六小时内 她来回的里程顶多九十英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 90 miles is her limit for six hours, and that's out and back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.91,1:09:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议我们往远一点走 那我们就需要加油了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reckon we've got to go further out. We'll need more gas for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.61,1:09:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们回拿索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's get back to Nassau.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.05,1:09:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 时间不多了 - 没错 时间是不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We haven't got much time. - You're right, we haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.77,1:10:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.81,1:10:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们当然在监视我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course they are watching us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.98,1:10:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然他们还能干嘛? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else have they to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.28,1:10:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你希望邦德死掉吗? - 想不出更好的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You would like Bond dead? - I can think of no better arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.25,1:10:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他想和你女人做爱? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he tries to make love to your woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.65,1:10:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是邦德 魔鬼党的敌人 应该除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he is Bond, and as an enemy of Spectre, he should be killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.66,1:10:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.03,1:10:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你昨晚的性急 造成邦德死亡的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Bond had died last night as a result of your hastiness...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.23,1:10:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的政府就会发现炸弹在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his government would have known for certain that the bombs are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.10,1:10:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时机成熟时 他会被杀 放!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the time is right, he will be killed. Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.87,1:10:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.18,1:10:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单独的池子 一定是为了养鲨鱼 靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A separate pool. For sharks, no less. Move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.55,1:10:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持航向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on that line.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.56,1:11:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那儿的确是拉果的地方 我下个拜访的地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Largo's place, all right. My next port of call.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.28,1:11:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉果先生? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Largo? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.12,1:11:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.17,1:11:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能帮忙吗? - 当然能 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I help? - Why, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.60,1:11:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然可以 - 这听起来特别令人动心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course you can. - That looks particularly inviting.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.61,1:11:56.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 欢迎到波米拉 - 我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome to Palmyra. - It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.04,1:11:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只希望没有打扰到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hope I'm not interrupting anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.51,1:12:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么意思? - 我以为你有别的访客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - I thought you had another visitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.89,1:12:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把枪好像较适合女孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That gun, it looks more fitting for a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.32,1:12:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对枪很有研究? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know much about guns?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我懂点女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I know a little about women.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.60,1:12:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚米先生 亚哥先生 亚哥先生 亚米先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jenni, Mr. Vargas. Mr. Vargas, Mr. Jenni.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.73,1:12:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪一位是哪一位? - 我想你那天晚上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which is which? - I thought you might have met...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.47,1:12:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该见过亚哥先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Vargas the other night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.97,1:12:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 喝酒吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, I believe I did. - Drink, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.28,1:12:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 兰姆可林酒好吗? - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rum Collins? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.45,1:12:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间正好 对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just about that hour, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.65,1:12:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你的? 当然 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.12,1:12:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚哥不喝酒 不抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vargas does not drink, does not smoke...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.69,1:12:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不做爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does not make love.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.19,1:12:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚哥 你会做什么? 每个人都有自己的喜好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do, Vargas? Every man has his passion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.33,1:12:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢钓鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine is fishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.57,1:12:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢 邦德先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is yours, Mr. Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.97,1:12:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你所谓有喜好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not what you'd call a passionate man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该换件衣服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time I went to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.58,1:13:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我带你参观一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must let me show you around.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.15,1:13:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很乐意 - 我想你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd love that. - I thought you might.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.49,1:13:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.19,1:13:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有什么比这更容易的? - 也许你能帮我放一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What could be easier? - Perhaps you would call one for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.60,1:13:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 当然 放! - 看来十分困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Of course. Pull! - It seems terribly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.57,1:13:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不难 对吧? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it isn't, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.71,1:13:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为不同的海洋水族馆 收集大型凶暴鱼类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I collect big game fish for various marine institutions.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.65,1:13:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分出色的动物 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent creatures!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.98,1:13:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.42,1:13:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶名昭彰的黄金鲨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The notorious Golden Grotto sharks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.42,1:13:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最野蛮 最危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most savage, the most dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.06,1:13:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们知道喂食的时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know when it's time for them to be fed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.16,1:13:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那船是你的吗? - 是 我十分以它为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That boat, is she yours? - Yes. I'm very proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.60,1:13:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑多快? 1 5节?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does she do, about 15 knots?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.33,1:14:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比那要好 接近20节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than that. Near 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.27,1:14:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许你想去看看 - 是 很想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Perhaps you'd like to see over her? - Yes, I would very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.31,1:14:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 午餐好了 - 亲爱的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lunch is ready. - Thank you, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.08,1:14:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 来吧 海鲜汤很香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come along, Mr. Bond. The conch chowder smells delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.98,1:14:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明诺 我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Domino, I was just thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.35,1:14:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然我今晚没空 也许邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I'll be busy this evening, perhaps Mr. Bond will be kind enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.88,1:14:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够带你去参加欢节庆 本地的嘉年华会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to take you to the Jankanoo, our local Mardi Gras.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.45,1:14:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我今晚的贵宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be my guest tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.46,1:14:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 非常谢谢你 - 是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's very kind of you. - It will be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.47,1:14:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生一定自视很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Mr. Bond must have a very high opinion of himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.14,1:14:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自视很高? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opinion?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.41,1:14:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也和我约了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. He has a date with me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.28,1:14:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.06,1:15:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 放开我 ! - 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me go! - Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.20,1:15:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让她大声嚷嚷 用迷魂剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let her make so much noise. Use the chloroform.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.61,1:15:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉果说过他会来 是吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largo did promise he'd come, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.98,1:15:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 他会到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be here. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.91,1:15:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想那傢伙在向你打招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that man is waving at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.45,1:15:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.38,1:15:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.35,1:16:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.66,1:16:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 詹姆斯 宝拉不见了 ! - 怎么会不见了 ?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James, Paula's gone! - What do you mean, gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.53,1:16:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已退房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just checked out of the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.70,1:16:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看好多明诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look after Domino. Watch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.77,1:16:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想她查到什么了吗? - 不知道 但我会查明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you think she was onto something? - I don't know, but I gotta find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.17,1:16:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看好她 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You watch out for her. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.94,1:16:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督不太开心 但已照你的要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The governor's not very happy, but you'll have...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.01,1:16:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全岛实施停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a power cut as requested all over the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.31,1:16:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管岛上其他的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a damn about the rest of the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.38,1:16:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只要波米拉停电 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want the lights out in Palmyra. - You'll have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.11,1:17:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思 她不肯招?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, she won't talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.38,1:17:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 她会招的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, she will.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.72,1:17:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 ? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.62,1:17:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 停电了吗? - 对 全岛都停电了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is it a power failure? - Yes, all over the island.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.26,1:17:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开紧急发电机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch over to the emergency generator.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.60,1:17:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉果告诉过你要小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largo told you to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.34,1:17:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没杀她 她一定是吞了毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't kill her. She must have taken some poison.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.44,1:18:01.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藏在嘴里 是不是氰化物? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A capsule in the mouth. What do you think, cyanide?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.04,1:18:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是警卫 有人打昏他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricardo, someone's got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.34,1:18:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搜索那边 你 到鲨鱼池! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search that way! And you, the shark pool!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.61,1:18:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么回事? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.65,1:18:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管他! 这边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.79,1:18:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.53,1:18:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜! 他让你们对彼此开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fools! He's got you all shooting at each other!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.47,1:19:07.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.21,1:19:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我有更好的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! I've got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.49,1:20:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开水闸 让它们吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lift the tunnel hatch and let them eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.20,1:20:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.74,1:21:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 希望你下次好运点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, old chap. Better luck next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.21,1:21:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉莱特看紧那个女孩 我会马上回去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Leiter to stay with the girl. I'll get back to him as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有事吗? - 告诉他宝拉死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anything else? - Tell him Paula's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.96,1:22:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是走错房间? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you in the wrong room?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.00,1:22:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我站的地方可没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from where I'm standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.67,1:22:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你来了 能不能给我穿些什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you're here, would you mind giving me something to put on?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.65,1:22:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 很高兴再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, I'm very glad to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.06,1:22:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很也高兴再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.43,1:22:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉你在躲我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the feeling you've been avoiding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.96,1:22:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我们是隔壁邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea that we were next-door neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.56,1:22:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们今天下午 才替我换房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just moved me down this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.07,1:22:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不寻常是吧? 似乎是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's extraordinary, isn't it? Almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.90,1:22:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故意的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if it was intended.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.04,1:23:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 很不寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.18,1:23:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要脱下湿衣服吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't you get out of those wet clothes?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.91,1:23:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会因感冒致死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll catch your death of cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.15,1:23:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我们快要迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you know we're going to be too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.02,1:23:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 迟到什么? - 欢节庆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too late for what? - The Jankanoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.96,1:23:22.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我答应我朋友在那碰面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised my friends I'd meet them there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.36,1:23:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你认识他 拉果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you know them, the Largos.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.13,1:23:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题 为何这么多问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Questions. All I get is questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.40,1:23:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正节庆会进行一整晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the music is gonna go on all night anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.11,1:23:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以让你好好狂野一下 你喜欢狂野吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough to drive you wild. Do you like wild things?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.21,1:23:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狂野 你该被关进笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wild. You should be locked up in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.59,1:23:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这张床有如笼子的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bed feels like a cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.02,1:23:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些铜条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these bars.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.19,1:23:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我在这里安全吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I'll be safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.21,1:24:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我的头发搞的乱七八糟 你这个性变态狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a shocking mess out of my hair, you sadistic brute.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.18,1:24:14.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,替我拉上拉链好吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you zip me up, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.45,1:24:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你衣服穿的这么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder you can get dressed so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.25,1:24:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路上 我们还可以聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the way, we can have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.82,1:24:26.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会很有兴趣的 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may find it interesting. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.26,1:24:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.79,1:24:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想错过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to think I'm gonna miss anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.23,1:24:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们可以找个地方 好好聊聊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we can go somewhere for an interesting talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.14,1:24:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这绝对是你的朋友 请进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends of yours, no doubt. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.11,1:24:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿衣服也很快 我从镜子里没看到枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dress quickly too. I didn't see that gun in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那无关紧要 但它一直都在枕头底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that it matters, but that was under the pillow all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.99,1:24:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候发现的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.52,1:24:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你戴的戒指跟拉果戴的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wearing the same ring as Largo.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.63,1:25:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是我喜欢戴的戒指 - 它本身有它的危险性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a ring I like to wear. - Then it has its dangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.46,1:25:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是虚荣 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vanity, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.46,1:25:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是一个你很了解的事 - 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's something you know so much about. - My dear girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.50,1:25:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别往自 己脸上贴金 我今晚所做的是为国王和国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't flatter yourself. What I did this evening was for King and Country.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.20,1:25:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为它带给我的是愉快吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't think it gave me any pleasure, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.38,1:25:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我忘了你的尊严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But of course. I forgot your ego.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.58,1:25:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德 只要他和女人做爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James Bond, who only has to make love to a woman...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.59,1:25:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就会听到天籁之音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she starts to hear heavenly choirs singing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.49,1:25:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她懊悔 而且立刻变得正派而纯洁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She repents and immediately returns to the side of right and virtue.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.39,1:25:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是这个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.17,1:25:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟会失败 一定是个打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a blow it must have been, you having a failure.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.70,1:25:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能每次都赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you can't win them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.01,1:25:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由大厅带他出去 去开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take him out the front way. Go and get the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.81,1:25:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邦德先生 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.43,1:26:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又要怎样? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.83,1:26:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知波米拉 告诉他们 我们被欢节庆游行挡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get through to Palmyra and tell them we've been held up by the Jankanoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.24,1:26:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要喝酒吗? - 赶他走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like to have a drink, man? - Get him away!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.31,1:26:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你别轻举妄动 - 滚开 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you try anything now. - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.48,1:26:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的烈酒 - 滚开 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's real firewater. - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.39,1:26:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追他! 抓住他! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.07,1:26:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到什么吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't seen anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.31,1:26:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.08,1:26:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟踪他 你走这边 你那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow him. You that side, you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.81,1:28:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟著我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.97,1:29:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(亲亲俱乐部)
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.96,1:30:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 我非常乐意 - 乐意什么? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you, I'd love to. - Love to what?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.97,1:30:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你疯了 你知道吗? - 对 大傢伙不都这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're mad. Do you know that? - Yes. Isn't everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.54,1:30:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能介入吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I cut in?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.61,1:30:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该告诉我 你太太也在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have told me your wife was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.16,1:30:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你常来吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you come here often?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.36,1:30:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no good trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.06,1:30:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.47,1:30:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很奇怪 我已经习惯你的脸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange as it may seem, I've grown accustomed to your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.88,1:30:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你何不安安静静的 跟我们走? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you come with us quietly?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.59,1:31:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不太了解 我很享受这个时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seem to understand. You see, I enjoy my dancing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.09,1:31:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不介意我朋友坐一下吗? 她刚刚死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind if my friend sits this one out? She's just dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.71,1:32:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在早上六点离开 停在雅典加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll leave here at 0600 hours and land at Aden to refuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.71,1:32:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后到满古群岛空投\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will then proceed to the Megui Archipelago...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.42,1:32:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要瞄准在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make your drop precisely at...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.15,1:32:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北纬20度 东经6 0度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 degrees north, 60 degrees east.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.02,1:32:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钻石将装在 特殊的容器内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The diamonds will be in a special container.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.59,1:32:13.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢像这样的让步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to give in like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.69,1:32:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,付了一大笔钱 还让他这样要挟我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paying the blood money, letting them beat us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.56,1:32:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有别的选择吗? - 恐怕没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you an alternative suggestion? - I'm afraid I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.70,1:32:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手下 007 我以为他会调查出什么端倪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your man, 007, I thought he was on to something.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.77,1:32:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也这么认为 - 假警报? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought so too, sir. - False alarm?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.94,1:32:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 恐怕是 - 很显然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm afraid so. - He obviously has...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.94,1:32:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,容我这么说 他极具戏剧性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a highly developed sense of, shall we say, drama?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.61,1:32:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果007认为他查到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If 007 thought he was on to something...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.95,1:32:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很可惜 他在开始前 没查清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a great pity he didn't make sure before he started to shout the odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.91,1:32:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还剩下1 4小时5 0分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we have exactly 14 hours and 50 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.78,1:32:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就得付款 而且要装出笑脸 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I suppose we shall have to pay up and look as happy as we can. Shan't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.43,1:33:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样了 詹姆斯 几乎全找过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's it, James. We've looked about everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.26,1:33:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要找到那飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to find that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.60,1:33:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面找不到 那是黄金礁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find it down there. That's the Golden Grotto.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.40,1:33:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 黄金礁? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Golden Grotto? - Yeah. All you'll find...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.64,1:33:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里只有鲨鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down there are sharks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.58,1:33:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,降低点 我要靠近点看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her down. I want a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.91,1:33:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 看什么? - 别管 ! 快降低点 !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At what? - Never mind! Take her down, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.56,1:33:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,降低点 我想我们找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set her down. I think we've found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.70,1:34:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下面有反光 我去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something camouflaged down there. I'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.84,1:34:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射其中一条鲨鱼 让其他鲨鱼忙一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot one of those sharks. It'll keep the others occupied.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.09,1:34:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道多久他们会吃光它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how long the others will take before they finish him off...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.56,1:34:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但他们会回来 - 我会注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- but they'll be back. - I'll keep an eye on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.76,1:34:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.66,1:36:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 它在下面 - 炸弹在船上吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's down there, all right. - Are the bombs on board?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.23,1:36:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不在 - 真要命 下一步怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Great. What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.57,1:36:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去查迪斯可戈兰号
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.57,1:36:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算炸弹不在船上 也马上就会到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the bombs aren't aboard her now, they soon will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.70,1:36:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要问谁 拉果吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you going to ask, Largo?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.31,1:36:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think we'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.20,1:37:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我们没吓到鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope we didn't frighten the fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.10,1:37:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海胆的刺 有毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow! Sea egg spines. They're poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.44,1:38:01.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.24,1:38:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.51,1:38:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now turn over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.98,1:38:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有点痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to hurt a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.33,1:38:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次尝女人的味道 还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first time I've tasted women. They're rather good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.70,1:38:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一让我哭的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the only man to ever make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.47,1:38:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我哥以外 我们小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except perhaps Francois, my brother, when we were children.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.67,1:38:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明诺 我得告诉你一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Domino, I have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.38,1:38:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 詹姆斯 我不是故意要 谈起爱让你难堪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, James. I didn't mean to embarrass you, speaking of love.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.31,1:38:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我必须再次伤害你 - 你要离开了吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must hurt you again. - You're going away?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.02,1:38:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甜心 抱歉 都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So sorry, my dear, but it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.95,1:38:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是有关你哥的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.95,1:38:49.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了 ? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.85,1:39:17.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.52,1:39:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.19,1:39:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长 这跟你朋友拉果有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story, and it involves your friend Largo.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.04,1:39:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.51,1:39:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.84,1:39:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为此才和我做爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you made love to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.85,1:39:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法解释这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I can't explain what this is all about.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.71,1:39:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但你一定要相信我 - 因为你要我帮你? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you must trust me. - Because you want me to help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.92,1:39:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉果派人谋杀你哥 或是他下的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largo had your brother murdered, or it was on his orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.65,1:39:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds of thousands of people will die very soon...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.16,1:40:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数以千计的人马上会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.76,1:40:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们所知道的 还有我们不知道的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That much we do know, but there's something we don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.93,1:40:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸弹 几时会 运到迪斯可戈兰号上? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bombs, when they're being loaded aboard the Disco Volante.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.44,1:40:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我怎么才会知道? - 你必须查明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How could I know that? - That you'll have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.78,1:40:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不容易 可能会很危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be easy. It could be very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.88,1:40:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还能对我做什么事? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can he do to me he hasn't already done?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.48,1:40:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯做吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.49,1:40:27.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.39,1:40:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是盖氏计算仪 你按这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a Geiger counter. You press this lever.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.43,1:40:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果开始有响声 表示核弹已经在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it starts clicking, it means the bombs are aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.56,1:40:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那时我该怎么办? - 到甲板上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do I do then? - Go straight up on deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.13,1:40:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当迪斯可戈兰号被监视时 你会被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the Disco Volante is being watched, you'll be spotted.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.17,1:40:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚哥在你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vargas, behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.10,1:40:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.44,1:40:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定跟踪我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have followed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.88,1:40:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他懂意思了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he got the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.95,1:41:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是拉果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It should have been Largo.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.55,1:41:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉果? 他期望你什么时候回去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largo? When did he expect you back?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.52,1:41:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快了 他说别太晚 他对这点非常坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very soon now. He said not to be late. He was most insistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.79,1:41:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好直接回去 我来料理亚哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better go straight back. I'll take care of Vargas and everything here.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.73,1:41:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是为了我哥这么做的 为了他对他做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand I'm doing this for my brother, for what he did to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.80,1:41:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论发生什么事 答应我杀了拉果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But promise you will kill Largo for me, whatever happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.14,1:41:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 时间不多了 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We haven't much time. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.21,1:41:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起一件事 也许不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, something I remembered. It may not be important.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.25,1:41:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 告诉我 每件事都很重要 - 运河上有条小桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me. Everything's important. - There's a small bridge over the canal.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.65,1:41:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉果绝不准陌生人靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Largo never allows strangers to go near it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.92,1:41:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,运河旁有一列台阶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the canal there's a flight of steps.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.16,1:41:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 通向哪儿? - 海底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do they lead to? - Down into the sea...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.43,1:41:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波米拉寓所的远方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the far side of Palmyra.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.69,1:41:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还是很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is important after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.92,1:43:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on your equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.11,1:43:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是否收到女孩登上 迪斯可戈兰号的讯息? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we get a message saying the girl went on board the Disco?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.51,1:43:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 讯号已经收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Signal received at...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.64,1:43:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果她已上船 007又在哪? - 这是个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If she is on board, where is 007 now? - That's the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.38,1:43:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备出发 倒数五秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by. Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.29,1:43:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意我的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch my signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.97,1:44:37.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备出发 - 遵命 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Prepare to get underway. - Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.44,1:44:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,船长 起锚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, weigh anchor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.88,1:44:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get underway immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.28,1:44:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦取了货品 就前往目标区 迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we pick up the merchandise, head for our target area, Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.62,1:44:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪斯可戈兰号出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Disco Volante's leaving, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.44,1:49:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我告诉过你待在舱房里 - 里面很闷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you to stay in your cabin. - It's stuffy in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.34,1:49:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要透透空气 - 你没听见吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want a breath of air. - My dear, did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.61,1:49:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个哪来的? - 今早买的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did you get that? - I bought it this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.65,1:49:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我看 - 不要 为什么要让你看? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me see. - No. Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.96,1:49:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是邦德先生给你的吧 而且亚哥已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bond gave you this little toy, I imagine, and Vargas is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.50,1:49:36.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甜心 你已经无路可逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, my dear. There is no escape for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.97,1:49:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你的朋友 你有点太聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like your friend, you've been a little too clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.67,1:49:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你被逮到 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you are caught!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.39,1:50:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多明诺 你给了我很多快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have given me much pleasure, Domino.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.26,1:50:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你告诉我 邦德知道多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in return, unless you tell me how much Bond knows...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.46,1:50:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我就被迫 回报你极大的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be forced to cause you great pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.43,1:50:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这代表热 这代表冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This for heat, these for cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.40,1:50:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很科学化 很缓慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Applied scientifically and slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.61,1:50:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常非常的慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very, very slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.05,1:51:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要什么? - 我们启动炸弹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - We're activating the bombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.12,1:51:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说你想知道 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said you wanted to be told. - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.36,1:51:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐和我之间的私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A private little matter between the young woman and myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.47,1:51:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.50,1:51:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 别指望了 没人来救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not live in hope, my dear. There is no one to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.89,1:51:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.62,1:51:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好他吞下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good thing the homing capsule he swallowed...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.53,1:51:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自动发报器仍管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is still working.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.83,1:51:41.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直直前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.47,1:51:49.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.72,1:52:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到他了 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.14,1:52:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.69,1:52:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.43,1:52:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用无线电通知 奥兰多海滩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your radio man on to Orlando Beach.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.04,1:53:01.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告他们 目标是迈阿密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warn them the target is Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.54,1:53:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时炸弹由迪斯可戈兰号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also, the bomb is transferred from the Disco Volante...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.68,1:53:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转换到富列点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}onto a wreck off Fowley Point.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.98,1:53:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 抓住这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Hang on to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.95,1:55:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望还沉得下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the kitchen sink.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.09,1:56:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切看来很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On you, everything looks good.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.79,1:56:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.73,1:56:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.12,2:03:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 起锚! - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weigh anchor! - Aye, aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.48,2:03:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 放烟雾 - 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make smoke. - Making smoke now.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.45,2:03:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(迪斯可戈兰号 巴拿马)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.49,2:04:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备分隔 - 待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand by for conversion. - Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.77,2:04:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分隔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jettison cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.04,2:04:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分隔完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cocoon's away.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.69,2:04:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续开火! 他们接近了 !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep firing! They're closing!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.25,2:04:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加强火力 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire more, more!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.76,2:05:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 ! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.37,2:05:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们仍有一枚炸弹在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've still got one bomb aboard.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.00,2:05:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他发疯了 ! 请帮我跟他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone mad! Please talk to them for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.71,2:05:19.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们我只是做我该做的 我只是奉命行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them that I only did what I had to do, what I was told to do.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.09,2:05:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他在哪儿? - 炸弹现在不能引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is he? - The bomb cannot be exploded now.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.13,2:05:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把引爆器丢进海里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I threw the arming device into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.20,2:05:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白吗? - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.97,2:05:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他! \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.05,2:07:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我很高兴我杀死他了 - 你很高兴? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm glad I killed him. - You're glad?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.95,2:07:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是谁? - 不知道 但他帮了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's he? - I don't know, but he helped me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.82,2:07:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 小心 ! 礁石 ! - 要触礁了 !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look out! The rocks! - The reef!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:47.86,2:07:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,控制器卡住了 ! 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's jammed the controls! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.29,2:07:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 快跳! - 我不会游泳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, now, jump! - I never learned to swim!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.30,2:07:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在学还不迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never too late to learn.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.40,2:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜下去 !\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!
